<button class="accordion"><strong>Can APC alumni borrow books?</strong></button>
<div class="panel">
  <br> <p>APC alumni are welcome to utilize APC library materials but within APC library premises only. They must present their alumni ID to the Librarian-in-charge.</p>
</div>

<br><h1><strong> Services </strong></h1>

<button class="accordion"><strong>Can I request a library instruction for my class? (For Full-Time & Adjunct Lecturer)</strong></button>
<div class="panel">
  <br> <p>Yes. A library instruction session may be scheduled upon request by APC full time faculty and Adjunct Lecturers. The session may be onsite or on hyflex mode. <br>
 
To request a library instruction session, please fill out <a href="https://forms.office.com/r/xeZxpacj28"> Library Instruction Request Form </a></p>
</div>

<button class="accordion"><strong>Can you help me with referencing?</strong></button>
<div class="panel">
  <br> <p>Please refer to <a href="https://library.apc.edu.ph/cgi-bin/koha/pages.pl?p=apc-library-guides-citation-tools"><strong> Online Bibliography & Citation Tools </a></strong></p>
</div>

<button class="accordion"><strong>I cannot go on-site, do you have a book scanning service?</strong></button>
<div class="panel">
